# SECTION 2 — GATHERING   b21-52   (0:40 - 1:40)
# Cycle  Dm | Dm7/C | Bbmaj7 | Bb6 | Gm | Gm7/F | Em7b5 | A7  (lament bass
# D-C-Bb-G-F-E-A) four times.  Layers by RATE: celli+basses quarters (b21),
# violas 8ths (b29), 2nd violins 16ths (b37), 1st violins 16ths (b41),
# dulcimer 8th-triplets + lutes + clarinets + horns (b45).  Taiko: the
# Chu-daiko answers the O-daiko (kakeai), call lengths 2 beats -> 1 bar ->
# half bar; b45 both lock into ji-uchi (3+3+2); b51-52 lead-in + "Sore!".

# -- b21-28 celli+basses: quarter-note arpeggios (cycle D-C-Bb-Bb-G-F-E-A);
# -- taiko KAKEAI: O-daiko calls (beats 1-2), Chu-daiko answers (beats 3-4).
== b21-28 [Gathering] ==
@ T=126 M=4/4 K=dm "Gathering — the strings come one by one" timp=d2,a2
@@ b21 T=126
odk:   | 8 {mf} c4> c4 4 c4> 2 r | 8 c4> c4 4 c4> 2 r | 8 c4> c4 8. c4> 16 c4 2 r | 8 c4> c4 4 c4> 2 r | 8. c4> 16 c4 8 c4> c4 2 r | 8. c4> 16 c4 8 c4> c4 2 r | 8. c4> 16 c4 8 c4> c4 4 c4> r | 4 c4> c4> c4> c4> |
chu1:  | 2 r 8 {mp} c4> 16 d4 c4> 4 r | 2 r 8 c4> 16 d4 c4> r d4 8 c4> | 2 r 8 c4> 16 d4 c4> 8 r g4 | 2 r 16 c4> d4 d4 c4> r g4 8 c4> | 2 r 8. c4> 16 c4 8 c4> c4 | 2 r 8. c4> 16 c4 8 c4> g4 | 2 r 8 r g4 c4> 16 d4 c4> | 8 r g4 r g4 r g4 r g4 |
dulc:  | {ks:Sus RR} 2 r 8 {mp} d4 a4 e5 f5 | 4 a5 8 f5 c5 2 r | 2 r 8 d4 a4 bb4 f5 | 4 g5 8 f5 bb4 2 r | 2 r 8 g4 d5 a5 bb5 | 4 bb5 8 f5 d5 2 r | 2 r 8 e4 bb4 d5 g5 | 4 g5 8 e5 a4 2 r |
vc:    | {ks:Stac On Bow RRx9} 4 {mp} d2> a2 f3 a2 | 4 c2> a2 d3 f3 | 4 bb2> f3 a3 f3 | 4 bb2> f3 g3 d3 | 4 g2> bb2 d3 g3 | 4 f2> bb2 d3 g3 | 4 e2> bb2 d3 g3 | 4 a2> c#3 e3 g3 |
cb:    =vc -8 {ks:Stac On Bow RRx9}

